{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Their wine is the venom of serpents.</b> In those clusters is found wine that is the venom of serpents, preserved within the grapes themselves. It is a punishment befitting them in the measure of justice, kept in store until the blessed El brings it forth from those grapes to make them drink it, as it says: פּוּרָה דָּרַכְתִּי לְבַדִּי (Isaiah 63:3)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:17.959039035Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}